BAZM SHAADI KI HAI HOTA HAI YE KAISA MATAM<br>
 KARTE HAI AHLE AZA AAJ YE KIS KA MATAM<br>
<br>
NEK LENE BHI NA PAYI KE MUJHE CHHOD GAYE,<br>
 KARTI HAI BHAI KA YEH KEHKE SAKINA MATAM<br>
<br>
DETI HAI ZAINAB-O-KULSOOM TASALLI UNKO,<br>
 CHAND SE BETE KA KARTI HAI JO FARWA MATAM<br>
<br>
HAYE DULHAN KO BHI RANDSALA PINHATE HAI KAHIN ,<br>
 KEHKE YE KARTI HAI QUD FATIMA KUBRA MATAM<br>
<br>
NA HI PAZEYB HI PEHNE GI NA KANGAN KUBRA,<br>
 AB RASAN BASTA DULHAN KO TOH HAI KARNA MATAM<br>
<br>
KOI HAMSIN NAHI WOH KISKO SUNAYE RUDAD,<br>
 CHAND LAMHO KI DULHAN KARTI HAI TANHA MATAM<br>
<br>
JAMA KARTE HUE QASIM KE BADAN KE TUKDE,<br>
 KARTE HAIN SHAHE HUDA IBNE HASAN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
KAASH SUGHRA YAHAN HOTI TOH TASALLI DETI,<br>
 YAAD AATI HAI BAHEN KARTI HAI KUBRA MATAM<br>
<br>
KYON NA PARWANA-E-QASIM BHI HO AB GIRYA KUNAA,<br>
 KARTI HAIN QASIM-E-NAUSHAH KA ZEHRA MATAM<br>
<br>
JEETE JI GHODON KI TAPAON SE JO PAMAAL HUA ,<br>
 HAI ZAMANE MEIN RASHEED AAJ USI KA MATAM..